> [!WARNING]
> Be sure your baseline expression is not identical to an expression you are using in any of your benchmarks. If it is, the individual benchmarks will reuse its
 cached types, leading to reduced (or 0) instantiations.

If you'd like to fail in CI above a threshold, you can add flags like the following (default value is 20%, but it will not throw unless `--benchErrorOnThreshold
Exceeded` is set):

```
